WEBVTT

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:04.310
<i>The Duel Carnival Semi-Finals have finally begun!</i>

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.940
<i>My opponent is Shark!</i>

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:10.780
<i>However, Shark’s heart was manipulated by Tron, which made him believe I was responsible for his sister's injury!</i>

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:14.280
<i>Open your eyes, Shark! You were deceived!</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.080
It's out.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.450
Shark’s Number!

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.710
Yuma!

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.040
What the heck is a Number?

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.840
I ain't never even heard of a Number before!

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.090
He said Number… I've never seen that kind of thing!

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.420
What is that?

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:32.300
What on Earth is that Monster?

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.840
So that’s Shark’s Number.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.550
It looks quite strong!

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.680
Yuma…

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:44.270
Oh~! What a fearsome Monster that is!

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:50.110
But it’s incredible. I have to get my hands on it!

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:55.570
Though you said that, 
you must be off somewhere overjoyed at this sight.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:59.030
But only for <i>now</i>, of course.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:04.850
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:10.190
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:27.040
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:32.840
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:37.430
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:43.470
<i>It's too soon for us to turn back now</i>

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:48.560
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:54.110
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:59.910
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:04.950
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:10.420
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:16.090
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:22.260
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:28.350
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:33.590
Go! Shark Drake, attack Gogogo Ghost!

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:36.460
"Number 62: Shark's Back!
 The Bonds Bounded By Bringin' it to 'Em!"

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.460
Depth Bite!!

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:49.560
Here comes another one, Yuma!

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.230
I know!

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:54.520
I activate Shark Drake’s effect!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:58.990
When it destroys a Monster by battle,
 by detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:05.160
it decreases the destroyed Gogogo Ghost’s Attack Power by 1000 points, and Special Summons it to Yuma’s field!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:10.620
Why would he Summon Yuma’s Monster back to his field?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:14.040
In order to attack once again!

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.750
You only have 900 Life left.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:20.340
After I destroy Gogogo Ghost again, you're finished!

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:26.760
Go, Shark Drake! Bite Gogogo Ghost and Yuma to pieces!

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.190
Yuma!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.560
Now Yuma will lose!

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.820
N-No way...

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:39.280
What?!

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:47.830
Gogogo Ghost and Gogogo Golem have…

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.330
…swapped!

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:52.540
Look! Yuma's Life hasn't changed at all!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:57.300
Wh-Why? Why would Gogogo Golem…

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.800
Thanks to Gogogo Ghost’s Monster Effect!

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:05.090
When Gogogo Ghost is Special Summoned, it can Special Summon Gogogo Golem from the Graveyard as well!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:10.980
Additionally, when this effect is used, Gogogo Ghost is changed to Defense Position!

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:16.110
Therefore, even if it was destroyed by Shark Drake, the damage I receive is still zero!

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:22.240
Desperate struggle for your life. I end my turn!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.110
That was amazing, Yuma!

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:25.740
Beautiful tactics!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.490
It must be thanks to Astral!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:32.460
Yuma is the one doing the fighting, so I won’t allow you to say something like that!

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.670
Yuma, do your best!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:40.880
Hmmm, that wasn't half bad.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.590
Dr. Faker: Numbers can only be defeated by Numbers.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:51.350
In order to win, Yuma Tsukumo has no choice but to Summon his own Number; the partition of that Original!

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:57.270
Yuma, use Hope! If you don't Summon Hope,
 there is no way we can win!

00:04:57.270 --> 00:05:05.240
I know that! But I only have Gogogo Golem on my field. If I can just get another Level Four Monster…

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.700
My turn! Draw!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.540
Darn it! It’s not a Monster Card!

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.960
Don’t panic, Yuma!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:19.290
Of course I'm panicking! If I don’t save him as soon as possible, he'll become Tron’s victim as well!

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:28.300
Wake up, Shark! If you still have a shred of your true heart, try to remember our Duels!

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.470
Our Duels?

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:36.770
That’s right! My first Duel ever with you was the battle that gambled mine and Tetsuo’s decks!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:41.230
Plus you and I had a Tag Duel before, too!

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:44.740
<i>Looks like our no-good Duelist improved a bit.</i>

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:51.580
I was really excited when you said that to me. Because I could tell that our hearts had finally connected!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:57.580
In order to protect this,
 you Dueled with Kaito, and that made he happy!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:06.420
With Dueling, we've continuously strengthened our bonds! Isn't that right, Shark?

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.140
Hmph! How boring.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.430
I have no idea about things like friends or bonds,

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.810
but none of those things matter to me!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:20.860
Now the only thing supporting me
 is my heart of vengeance towards you!

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:27.780
Bravo! Nice, very nice! You're the best!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:30.160
Shark…

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:34.950
I am here to defeat you in order to avenge my younger sister.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:39.290
So what’s <i>your</i> purpose here?
 Didn't you come here to <i>defeat</i> me?

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:44.840
Spare me from your almighty speech and just come at me! Your turn has already started!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:51.680
I know! If that’s what you want, I'll just have to deliver my thoughts through Dueling!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:55.770
I switch Gogogo Golem from Defense Position to Attack Position!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:01.310
Then I activate Quick-Play Magic, Golden Form!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:09.950
This card, when a Monster is switched from Defense Position to Attack Position, doubles that Monster's Attack Power until my next turn!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:18.750
Oh, how amazing this shiny sight is!
 It is indeed Golden Burning!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:23.580
What is Yuma thinking? Even if he managed to power-up Gogogo Golem…

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:26.460
To summarize, it still cannot defeat the Number!

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.840
Yuma…

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.470
Yeah, I know.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:35.850
But even if I can’t defeat his Number, I'll still charge from head-on and deliver my feelings to Shark!

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.640
That’s all I can do for now.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:44.190
Go, Gogogo Golem, attack Shark Drake! Great Cannon!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:56.950
Wake up, Shark! Hurry and get a hold of yourself!

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:06.670
<i>It's a hit! Yuma’s super-heavy strike was effective! Now Yuma and Shark are tied at 900 Life!</i>

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:16.100
Realizing he can't defeat my Number, he starts depleting my Life? But it ends now.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:21.520
I set one card and end my turn!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.230
My turn, draw!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:28.940
Yuma, this time I will finish you off completely...

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.660
...in order to avenge my sister and pay you back!

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.950
Here it comes, Yuma!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.790
What’s that? What’s happening?

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.040
His body is glowing!

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:54.840
I use Marine Biting Dragon - Shark Drake as Xyz Material to Chaos Xyz Change!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.890
Show yourself, Chaos Number 32!

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:13.650
Marine Biting Dragon - Shark Drake Vice!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.660
Wh-What in the world?!

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.620
Ch…Chaos Number?!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:24.830
That’s…

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:29.250
It finally appeared!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.710
His Chaos Number…

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.140
Chaos Number…

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:49.650
Under the current situation, we are overwhelmingly disadvantaged!

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:53.610
Here I go! I activate Shark Drake Vice’s Monster Effect!

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:59.370
By detaching one Overlay Unit, it Banishes one “Shark” Monster in the Graveyard.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:07.460
I choose Spear Shark! And Gogogo Golem loses Attack Power equal to its 1600 Attack Power!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:10.920
Go, Spear Shark! Pierce it!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.380
This is bad, Yuma!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:16.340
Yuma: I got it! I activate the Permanent Trap, Power Changer Barrier!

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:21.430
By decreasing Gogogo Golem’s Attack Power by 600...

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:26.980
...this card can negate Shark Drake Vice's effect!

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.480
He just blocked that!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:33.320
But Shark Drake Vice still has Overlay Units left!

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.690
It will strike again!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:35.400
Understood!

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.990
Then I will let you taste that once again!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.910
By detaching an Overlay Unit, it Banishes a Monster in the Graveyard!

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:51.960
I select Two-Head Shark! And Gogogo Golem’s Attack Power loses this card’s 1200 Attack Power!

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:55.250
Ram him, Two-Head Shark!

00:10:55.800 --> 00:11:01.300
Then I activate Power Changer Barrier’s effect again! It negates that Monster Effect!

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:09.480
It’s not over yet! I still have one Overlay Unit left!

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:19.320
I choose Shark Drake in my Graveyard! Letting Gogogo Golem’s Attack Power lose its 2800 Attack Power! Take this!

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.780
Defend it! Power Changer Barrier!

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:33.750
He finally managed to power up its Attack Power to 3600, but now he decreased it to 1800 with his own hands.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:40.050
Plus, now Yuma only has 900 Life left. Does he even know what he’s doing?

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:46.060
It’s useless. The difference between Shark Drake Vice and Gogogo Golem’s Attack Power is 1000.

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:48.390
If this attack connects, it’s over!

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:54.020
Do it, Shark Drake Vice! Attack Gogogo Golem!

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.190
Depth Chaos Bite!!

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.700
Trap, activate! Half Unbreak!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:10.870
Thanks to this effect, Gogogo Golem will not be destroyed, and my damage is halved!

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:25.840
What persistence. But when my next turn comes, you will fall into Hell completely!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:29.140
I set one card and end my turn!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:33.100
That’s right, it’s over when the next turn comes. Over for good.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:41.400
With that card I gave Ryoga as a present, Yuma Tsukumo will be eliminated!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.700
Power Change Barrier saved us.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:51.700
We only have 400 Life left. Let’s settle it during this turn!

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:52.540
I know!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:58.420
I…I…I believe in myself and my own deck!

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.750
I'm gonna bring it to 'im!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:02.420
Draw!!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:07.140
Got it! I Summon Gagaga Magician!

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:17.560
I Overlay the Level Four Gagaga Magician and Gogogo Golem!

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:22.030
I build the Overlay Network with these two Monsters!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:23.820
Xyz Summon!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.200
It's time to show yourself, Number 39!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:31.200
Aspiring Emperor- Hope!

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:42.920
You fool! Even if you managed to Summon Hope now, it can't defeat Shark Drake Vice with its 2500 Attack Power!

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:47.430
All you can do is pitifully struggle with
 the conviction of eventual defeat!

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:51.430
You're wrong!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:57.100
Hope won't die! Neither will your Number!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:03.440
I wish to save you, and of course I don’t want lose either!

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:08.660
I desire to become the champion of the Duel Carnival, and finally settle the score with Tron and Dr. Faker.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:13.490
But even if I win, I would feel worse losing you!

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:20.500
Therefore, I… I will save you using whatever method necessary!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.880
I will release you from Tron’s curse!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:31.300
Here I come, Shark! I attack Shark Drake Vice with Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.180
Hope Sword Slash!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:40.900
So in the end, you still run out of ideas and solely charge head on?

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:44.360
Fight back! Depth Chaos Bite!

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:55.910
I detach one Overlay Unit, and activate Hope’s effect! It negates a Monster’s attack!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.920
He actually negated Hope’s attack?

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:02.880
Now, Yuma!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:08.220
I activate the Permanent Trap, Bonds of Rival!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:18.810
When my Monster’s attack is negated, I can equip this card to the battling Monster my opponent controls, and I gain that Monster’s control!

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:21.940
Im…impossible!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:29.190
Latch on to me, Shark Drake Vice! Leave Shark alone and come to my side!

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.740
Yuma took Shark’s Number…

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.200
...away?!

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.660
But that way, Yuma will…

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:56.260
Take it back, Shark! Your true heart!

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.730
<i>Yuma Tsukumo, I'll remember you.</i>

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:03.480
<i>Obviously because we're friends!</i>

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.400
<i>Don't get involved with me anymore...</i>

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.070
<i>Something about revenge...</i>

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.820
<i>We'll settle things in the Finals!</i>

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.780
<i>I don’t want to see that!</i>

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:20.950
<i>Y-Yuma... It wasn't Yuma... who hurt my little sister...</i>

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:27.250
<i>Tron was the one who hurt my sister!</i>

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:32.590
I've been controlled by the Number this entire time!

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.340
Yuma!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.600
Shark!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.100
Yuma!

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:46.360
<i>Yuma sure is suffering, isn't he?</i>

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:47.650
Tron!

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:53.700
At this rate, it’ll be his turn to be manipulated by the Number. What will you do, Ryoga?

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:58.530
He has redeemed you from agony, 
and now he is suffering in your place.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.710
Yuma!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:06.880
Tron: You wish to save him, yes? Assuming you are one of his friends, too.

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:11.340
What should I do?

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:21.970
It seems you have recalled it. That’s right, just use that Trap Card. Use Medallion Catastrophe!

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.890
Medallion…Catastrophe…

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.980
Yuma...! Yuma!

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.020
At this rate...

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:33.190
It’s alright! Pretty soon Ryoga will come and save you!

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:34.280
Tron…

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:43.410
Thanks to your effort of stealing Shark Drake Vice, that Trap Card on Ryoga’s field, Medallion Catastrophe, can be activated now.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:51.630
When the opponent gains control of your Monster, this card can destroy all Monsters with Attack Power equal to or lower than that Monster's.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:57.970
In other words, both Shark Drake Vice and Aspiring Emperor - Hope will be destroyed.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.600
WHAT?! Even Hope too…

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:03.810
Tron(to Shark): That way Yuma can escape from the curse of the Number, too.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:11.480
However, the total of the destroyed Monsters’ Attack Power, in other words, 5300 damage, will be inflicted to him.

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:22.030
That way victory will be yours. I gave that card to you because I knew something like this would happen. A sure-kill Trap, that is.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.710
If Hope is destroyed, then Astral, too…

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.790
Is…is there any other way?

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:41.220
Right! Traplin! By releasing one Permanent Trap on the field, it can be Special Summoned.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:44.680
If I use this effect to destroy Bonds of Rival…

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:50.150
That’s right, Shark Drake Vice would return to Shark, and Hope and I will be saved.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:56.320
But he will be controlled by the Number, no, Tron again.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:05.450
That’s right. Alright, which side will you choose? Ryoga or Astral?

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:08.120
Tron!

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:10.250
You decide, Yuma.

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.040
Astral…

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:20.720
There is nothing more I can do under these circumstances. This is your Duel. You will do the thinking and make the decisions.

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:25.930
But I can't... I can't choose between you and Shark!

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:31.690
Shark: Yuma!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:36.860
If you don’t save him as soon as possible, he will only suffer more and more.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:42.110
So do it, Ryoga. Activate Medallion Catastrophe.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:48.500
Be it Shark Drake Vice, Aspiring Emperor - Hope, along with Yuma Tsukumo... Bury them together!

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:51.920
Yuma!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:20:07.180
I can't choose... I just can't choose! Because to me, both you and Shark are very important... friends!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:09.640
Yuma…

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:17.570
That set card is the one I set from the very beginning. I…

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:21.820
I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Marine Snow Seal!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:25.910
I Banish Shark Drake Vice!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:41.840
I will receive 1000 points of damage as the price!

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.140
Shark!!

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:59.360
The…The winner is…Contestant Yuma Tsukumo…

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.570
Yuma…

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:09.620
Get a hold of yourself, Shark! Hey!
 In order to save us, you…

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:15.080
Yuma, during the Duel, I could always hear your voice.

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:21.630
That heart of yours that never gives up, your "Bring it to 'Em", has saved me from Tron.

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:29.010
Thank you. Also, please, defeat Tron! You can definitely do it!

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:33.230
So that’s friendship and bonds?

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:38.520
Just when will you get enough out of getting in my way, Yuma!?

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:46.660
Oh well. I will finish off Yuma Tsukumo nice and slowly later... with my own hands!

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:51.490
He is the one who saved my life.

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:57.170
Right. I didn't win this Duel. He gave victory to me.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.090
Additionally, you were entrusted his feelings.

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:04.840
Right, I'll inherit all of Shark's feelings and definitely win!

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:07.840
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:15.520
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:21.150
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:31.830
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:36.080
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:37.370
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:40.080
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:42.710
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:47.920
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:53.260
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:58.890
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:05.400
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:10.860
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:16.120
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:21.750
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:26.960
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:32.470
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>
